%% Track lifecycle states and the age-driven transitions (A06).
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Observed: first observation
  Observed --> Observed: fresh observation (age <= observed window)
  Observed --> Extrapolated: age past observed window
  Extrapolated --> Observed: new observation arrives
  Extrapolated --> Stale: age past extrapolation horizon
  Stale --> Observed: new observation arrives
  Stale --> Lost: age past stale horizon
  Lost --> Observed: aircraft reappears
  Observed --> Ended: landed and stopped reporting
  Stale --> Ended: no return within policy
  Ended --> [*]

  note right of Extrapolated
    Position is extrapolated from the last
    known velocity for at most the declared
    horizon. It is never extended silently.
  end note
